> The Impact of Generative AI on Data Analyst Job Functions: Evidence from China’s First-Tier Cities

**Author:** *Feiyu Zhou*
**Course:** MSG 3001 WHS01 — Empirical Analysis of the Business, Economic, or Societal Impact of AI
**Semester:** Spring 2026

